{"id":"212eda9b-0fe1-800e-910d-cc2100e77faa","title":"1.2 SSE ( Server-Sent Events )","parentId":"210eda9b-0fe1-8058-abd9-eceec7820379","category":"Spring ( Java )","categoryId":"source:Spring ( Java )","createdAt":"2025-06-14T06:55:10.276Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-13T15:03:27.813Z","markdown":"<a id=\"213eda9b0fe1802fac72d23a8b8e5914\"></a>\n\n‣\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe18052a218cfccccf9953f\"></a>\n\n‣\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe1809cbc72d6987f09572e\"></a>\n\n‣\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe180878ad3ce00a07c485f\"></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/vpavic/samples-spring-sse-redis\">https&#58;//github&#46;com/vpavic/samples&#45;spring&#45;sse&#45;redis</a>\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe1808dae2bce7c07279562\"></a>\n\n‣\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe180228f89df9c09f18202\"></a>\n\n‣\n\n<a id=\"212eda9b0fe180dd960ad461ec7b3d7e\"></a>\n\n## <strong> Server&#45;Sent Events (SSE)</strong>\n\n---\n\n> 📖 \n> \n> <a id=\"212eda9b0fe180ae8628ffda15285204\"></a>\n> \n> <strong><code>SSE ( Server&#45;Sent Events )</code></strong>는 <u>서버가 </u><strong><u>HTTP 연결을 유지</u></strong>하면서 <strong><u>클라이언트에게 실시간으로 데이터를 push</u></strong>할 수 있는 기술이다&#46;\n> \n> - HTTP/1&#46;1 기반 단방향 통신 (서버 → 클라이언트)\n> \n> - <code>Content&#45;Type&#58; </code><strong><code>text/event&#45;stream</code></strong> 사용\n> \n> - 클라이언트는 <strong><code>EventSource API</code></strong>로 구독\n\n<details>\n<summary>의존성&#58; <code>starter&#45;data&#45;redis</code>, <code>starter&#45;webflux</code></summary>\n\n<a id=\"213eda9b0fe180a99e49c6256b94671b\"></a>\n\n```javascript\nimplementation 'org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-data-redis'\nimplementation 'org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-webflux'\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>WebFlux SSE 주요 내용</strong></summary>\n\n- <strong>Spring WebFlux의 SSE 지원</strong>\n    <a id=\"28beda9b0fe180d9a9f8f9204e7f59b1\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    // \tSSE 엔드포인트 정의\n    @GetMapping(produces = MediaType.TEXT_EVENT_STREAM_VALUE)\n    ```\n\n    - <code>Flux&#60;T&#62;</code>,  <code>Mono&#60;T&#62;</code> 를 통해 HTTP 스트림 응답 제공\n\n    - 내결합성 및 백프레셔(backpressure) 설계\n\n- <strong>Spring Data Redis의 리액티브 Pub/Sub</strong>\n    <a id=\"28beda9b0fe1808f8f90e42afbe3924b\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    // 메시지 발행\n    ReactiveRedisOperations.convertAndSend(...)\n\n    // 지원\n    ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory\n    \t\t.getReactiveConnection()\n    \t\t.pubSubCommands()\n    \t\t.publish(...)\n    \t\t\n    // 채널 구독\n    ReactiveRedisOperations\n    \t\t.listenToChannel(...)\n    ```\n\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180e989d0f7f399370321\"></a>\n\n    <br>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>ex) Spring WebFlux  SSE</strong></summary>\n\n- <strong>아키텍처 요약</strong>\n    <a id=\"212eda9b0fe180638337cd5b81a8db31\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n              [브라우저]\n                 │\n                 ▼\n     EventSource('/sse/subscribe')\n                 │\n                 ▼\n     ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n     │       Spring WebFlux         │\n     │  @GetMapping + Flux<String>  │\n     │ produces = text/event-stream │\n     └──────────────────────────────┘\n                 │\n                 ▼\n         메시지 발생 (Flux emit)\n     \n              ↙          ↘\n        Redis Pub/Sub   Kafka\n    ```\n\n    1. 클라이언트는 <code>/see/subscribe</code>  엔드포인트로 연결\n\n    1. 서버는 Flux를 통해 메세지를 지속적으로 push\n\n    1. 메세지 소스는 내부 <code>Queue</code>, <code>Redis</code>, <code>Kafka</code> 등 다양\n\n- <strong>Controller</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180aeb600f7cd4c5b675b\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    @GetMapping(value = \"/sse/subscribe\", produces = MediaType.TEXT_EVENT_STREAM_VALUE)\n    public Flux<String> subscribe() {\n        return Flux.interval(Duration.ofSeconds(1))\n               .map(seq -> \"data: 현재 시간 = \" + LocalDateTime.now() + \"\\n\\n\");\n    }\n    ```\n\n    - <code>TEXT&#95;EVENT&#95;STREAM&#95;VALUE</code>&#58; text/event&#45;stream MIME 타입\n\n    - <code>Flux&#46;interval(Duration&#46;ofSeconds(1))</code>&#58; 1초마다 메세지를 push\n\n- <strong>클라이언트(JS)</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180cb879ffcc9d0facaaa\"></a>\n\n    ```javascript\n    <script>\n    \tconst eventSource = new EventSource(\"/see/subscribe\");\n    \t\n    \teventSource.onmessage = (e) => {\n    \t\tconsole.log(\"수신된 메세지: \", e.data);\n    \t};\n    \t\n    \teventSource.onerror = (e) => {\n    \t\tconsole.error(\"SSE 오류: \", e);\n    \t};\n    <script>\n    ```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>ex2) <strong>Spring WebFlux &#43; 리액티브 Redis 기반의 실시간 SSE 채팅 시스템</strong></summary>\n\n- <strong>아키텍처 요약</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180188553cf926194cb5d\"></a>\n\n    ```javascript\n    [클라이언트 브라우저]\n         │                       ▲\n         │ SSE 구독               │ 채팅 메시지 전송 (POST)\n         ▼                       │\n    [ WebFlux Controller ] ←─────┘\n         │\n         ▼\n    [ Redis (Pub/Sub) ]\n         ▲\n         │\n    [ ReactiveRedisSubscriber (Flux sink → emit) ]  // 서버 동기화 \n    ```\n\n    > ✏️ \n    > \n    > <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180839325d0ffb376b4b0\"></a>\n    > \n    >  클러스터 환경 동기화를 위한 <code>Redis pub/sub</code> 추가\n\n- <strong>의존성 설정 ( Gradle ) </strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe18010a3bfffb699244ad8\"></a>\n\n    ```groovy\n    dependencies {\n        implementation 'org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-webflux'\n        implementation 'org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-data-redis'\n    }\n    ```\n\n    - <a href=\"https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-starter-data-redis\"><code>spring&#45;boot&#45;starter&#45;data&#45;redis</code></a>&#58; 리액티브 Redis API 포함 ( ReactiveTemplate )\n\n    - <code>spring&#45;boot&#45;starter&#45;webflux</code>&#58; Flux, Mono, SEE 기반 비동기 스트리밍 제공\n\n- <strong>Redis 설정</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180e28e12f2054bddc76d\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    @Configuration\n    public class RedisConfig {\n\n        @Bean\n        public ReactiveRedisTemplate<String, String> reactiveRedisTemplate(ReactiveRedisConnectionFactory factory) {\n            RedisSerializationContext<String, String> context = RedisSerializationContext\n                    .<String, String>newSerializationContext(RedisSerializer.string())\n                    .value(RedisSerializer.string())\n                    .build();\n            return new ReactiveRedisTemplate<>(factory, context);\n        }\n    }\n    ```\n\n- Redis 채팅 서비스\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe18042bf88c85924ad834e\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    @Service\n    @RequiredConstructor\n    public class ChatService {\n\n    \t\tprivate final ReactiveRedisTemplate<String, String> redisTemplate;\n    \t\tprivate final Sink.Many<String> sink = Sink.many().multicast().onBackpressureBuffer();\n    \t\t\n    \t\tpublic Mono<Long> sendMessage(String roomId, String message) {\n    \t\t\t\treturn redisTemplate.convertAndSend(\"chatroom:\" + roomId, message); \t\t\t\t\n    \t\t}\n    \t\t\n    \t\tpublic Flux<String> subscribe(String roomId) {\n    \t\t\t\treturn redisTemplate.listenToChannel(\"chatroom:\" + roomId)\t\t\n    \t\t}\n    }\n    ```\n\n- <strong>WebFlux Controller</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe1808bb7fbd9fe8566f424\"></a>\n\n    ```java\n    @RestController\n    @RequiredArgsConstructor\n    @RequestMapping(\"/chat\")\n    public class ChatController {\n\n        private final ChatService chatService;\n\n        @PostMapping(\"/{roomId}\")\n        public Mono<Long> sendMessage(@PathVariable String roomId, @RequestBody String message) {\n            return chatService.sendMessage(roomId, message);\n        }\n\n        @GetMapping(value = \"/subscribe/{roomId}\", produces = MediaType.TEXT_EVENT_STREAM_VALUE)\n        public Flux<String> subscribe(@PathVariable String roomId) {\n            return chatService.subscribe(roomId);\n        }\n    }\n    ```\n\n- <strong>클라이언트 (HTML &#43; JS)</strong>\n    <a id=\"213eda9b0fe180578cebf2a4a7a467dc\"></a>\n\n    ```javascript\n    <script>\n    const roomId = 'main';\n    const eventSource = new EventSource(`/chat/subscribe/${roomId}`);\n\n    eventSource.onmessage = function (event) {\n        console.log(\"💬\", event.data);\n    };\n\n    function sendMessage(msg) {\n        fetch(`/chat/${roomId}`, {\n            method: 'POST',\n            body: msg,\n            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'text/plain' }\n        });\n    }\n    </script>\n    ```\n\n</details>\n","path":"posts/212eda9b-0fe1-800e-910d-cc2100e77faa/1.2 SSE ( Server-Sent Events ).md","url":"https://beautiful-college-c84.notion.site/212eda9b0fe1800e910dcc2100e77faa","excerpt":"‣ ‣ ‣ https&58;//github&46;com/vpavic/samples&45;spring&45;sse&45;redis ‣ ‣ Server&45;Sent Events (SSE) --- 📖 SSE ( Server&45;Sent Events ) 는 서버가 HTTP 연결을 유지 하면서 클라이언트에게 실시간으로 데이터","cover":null,"icon":null,"order":2,"revision":"c760cdd037ee3d789a747c59af0fa615e053783eb92b34919b03e26b6ded6865","bodyLoaded":true}